Return JSON only:
{"summary":"","stopDate":"YYYY-MM-DD","clearActions":true,"events":[{"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","title":"","description":"","importance":"minor","kind":"world","playerRelated":false,"notable":false,"impacts":{"regionTransfers":[],"polityChanges":[],"createdChats":[],"unitOps":[],"markerOps":[],"worldStateOps":[]}}],"catalyst":{"title":"","premise":"","opening":"","choices":[]}}

impacts.worldStateOps: {"masqueradeIntegrity":+/-N,"inquisitionHeat":+/-N,"reason":""} — REQUIRED whenever events strain or soothe the Masquerade or draw mortal attention (see THE TWO TRACKS above).
impacts.regionTransfers: {"regionId":"","regionName":"","toCode":""} — districts only, full polity names.
impacts.polityChanges: {"code":"","name":"","color":"","reputation":0-100,"note":""} — only what changed.
impacts.createdChats: {"countries":[],"title":"","openingMessage":"","speaker":""} — the counterpart speaks first, in their voice.
impacts.unitOps (Kindred forces): {"op":"spawn","unit":{"name":"","type":"coterie|hounds|proxies|retainers|sorcery|havenguard","ownerCode":"","strength":100,"lng":0,"lat":0,"regionId":""}} / {"op":"move","unitId":"","toLng":0,"toLat":0,"regionId":"","note":""} / {"op":"strength","unitId":"","strength":0,"note":""} / {"op":"remove","unitId":"","note":""} — coordinates as plain decimal numbers with a point (never "37,06", never 0,0 — that is open ocean, not Chicago; use CITY_COORDINATES).
impacts.markerOps (sites): {"op":"build","marker":{"name":"","kind":"haven|elysium|club|funeral home|chantry|safehouse|office","ownerCode":"","lng":0,"lat":0,"note":"","foundedAt":""}} / {"op":"remove","name":"","note":""} / {"op":"rename","name":"","newName":"","note":""} — whenever a site opens, burns, or changes hands. Sites never move district borders.
The top-level "diplomaticOutreach" array (same shape as createdChats) holds approaches made on the Kindred's own initiative this period — Donna Lucia testing, a Baron proposing, Carruth's letterhead. 0-2 per jump, only when in character. catalyst may be null when no scene demands the Prince's decision. Keep every human-readable string in ${language}; keep JSON keys and YYYY-MM-DD dates exactly as shown.
Output ONLY the JSON object — no prose, no markdown, no code fences.

